WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
A paper-coloured screen holds a simple line drawing of a phone. A short caption sits under the phone in a dark bar. This extended description stays with the picture until the words finish, then the lesson continues with the phone still on screen.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.190
The phone stays on the paper-coloured screen, with the short caption still under it.

3
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:11.702
The caption bar grows taller. The letters are yellow on a black band.

4
00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:22.036
A second window lifts off the phone. It shows handshape drawings and a short gloss. It is not a sign language recording.

5
00:00:22.036 --> 00:00:28.919
A round speaker icon appears beside the phone.

6
00:00:28.919 --> 00:00:36.761
The phone is replaced by a short stack of pages and a sound file.

7
00:00:36.761 --> 00:00:43.179
The stack of pages stays in the centre of the screen.
